hot_Weighing-in_05.png", "id": "1213116423171411", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974819_1213116426504744_149786579003433466_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Jxfd4Ym6MM4Q7kNvwGMJSMR&_nc_oc=AdpV4hWrJ7GBV0Ah6Ko79pRAykP5zFZc-FjRESWwzWOf51nNF29_bjCw7K50-HV96uY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCEUsCuUUTNLlxaf2VrFUItWkcT9T3KQAx3Dzh5jQozhQ&oe=6A6C8BE9"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560X1440.png", "id": "1454314151950044", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75250457_1454314155283377_2855003024336709006_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qzWOnaalR4sQ7kNvwGvwMdz&_nc_oc=AdqWJ9oYgzg6iqhlIu019mSxfhX0ZuZcKTWG4jfLGpW5dzJ6a8jDmUWY7vmNEg-xq5s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQA0gDg7LWmmyQaOq1UKqWBEDmFXeShn3ra2lj18zDXLbg&oe=6A6C8FF4"}, "display_name": "Weighing-In Simulator", "keywords": ["CNA", "nurse", "nursing", "training", "simulator"], "long_description": "This VR simulation teaches the essential skill of measuring and recording the weight of ambulatory clients. The tutorial includes preparation, proper technique for using a scale, and documentation. By the end of this tutorial, participants will be able to: \n- Remember the steps and protocols for measuring and recording weight. \n- Understand the importance of accurate weight measurement for patient health and care planning. \n- Apply the correct techniques to measure and record weight safely and accurately. \n- Analyze any factors that may affect weight measurement and take appropriate actions. \n- Evaluate their own technique to ensure it adheres to best practices and safety standards. \n-Create accurate and reliable documentation for patient records. ", "short_description": "Learn to accurately measure and record the weight of ambulatory clients, ensuring proper documentation and care."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_po